---
title: About
---
body:

I am a Solutions Architect and Technical Lead with 8+ years of software engineering experience, including 5+ years specializing in Kubernetes, AWS, and cloud-native distributed systems.

My background spans healthcare platform architecture, high-availability infrastructure, GitOps automation, and backend engineering.

### Career Highlights

- **Healthcare Scale**: Architected systems deployed across 14 hospitals, supporting 24 microservices and ~1,400 daily users with a 99.95% SLA.
- **Production Kubernetes**: Designed and operated 5 production clusters across 36 production nodes, plus unified observability across 48 production and UAT nodes.
- **GitOps Automation**: Built automated CI/CD and deployment pipelines that cut release cycles from ~5 minutes to ~50 seconds.
- **Healthcare Standards**: Engineered real-time hospital integrations using HL7, MLLP, PACS, and LIS.

### Approach

I enjoy solving complex infrastructure, reliability, and architecture problems, but I remain hands-on writing code, debugging systems, and building automation pipelines.
